notes.content:
Hello, snanchers!!

Thank you to all of you who played our demo so far!
Today we are introducing the new version of Scaling Up's demo, with a lot of new things.

Patch Notes Demo - v0.3
New

Game now has a duration of 15 in-game days;
Research System is unlocked so players can discover more of Scaling Up. It comes with its own building and Snakes;
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45325324/c178d7493b5198e6cbf7bc12bb6cfd6201564053.gif
More Snakes to meet;
More expeditions to conquer;
More equipments to craft;
Ranch Expansion! Players can now open the spaces surrounding the Ranch to increase the area;
Encyclopedia System, where players can collect insects and fishes to catalog. This system is independent of the Save Files, so it transfers throughout the game;
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45325324/0f594d214988827b8c314bdc515cd316bf33c007.gif
Save Files. Players can make different save files to play. The game auto-saves each in-game day and the player can save anytime on the Settings menu;
Snakes that work outside their buildings can now be selected directly by clicking on them. Snakes that stay in building don't require that feature since they are already in the building;
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45325324/218a03e6af1a5a813714e7d35de66df883e56f86.gif


Adjustments

Change the behaviour of Transporter Pythons and Caretaker Snakes. They now have a working radius in the building and will work on their own without the need for directions. This means that, however, they cannot work outside the building radius;
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45325324/7960ff8075b2bad85ad7e253af84ce62229568c2.gif
Gathering Spots slots are now functional, so players can send Snakes through them directly if needed;
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45325324/cafa91a5919360ff98e7323114735e481856c55a.gif


Decorations will be implemented soon!


We hope everyone enjoy this new version of Scaling Up's demo, as we continue to cook new things for the game for its final launch!
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45325324/e0a9c0fd70d054456e818f32289c101cfd4a61bc.gif
There are still a lot of details to complete for the final game, so keep an eye out for the release of Scaling Up! We will make a proper announcement later when we have a release date or window ready!

And if you have time, leave a review on the demo! It is really helpful to us! :)
